falcon-storage provides CMake targets:

    find_package(FalconStorage CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Falcon::storage)

falcon-storage provides the following features (all on by default):

  s3      Amazon S3 resource browser
  oss     Aliyun OSS resource browser
  cos     Tencent COS resource browser
  kodo    Qiniu Kodo resource browser
  upyun   Upyun resource browser
